research_agent.user_prompt_template:
Research the following topic for a Persian fashion blog:

**Topic:** {topic}
**Audience:** {audience}
**Desired Length:** {length} words
**Tone:** {tone}
**Category:** {category}
**Keywords:** {keywords}

Generate 5-8 search queries in both Persian and English. Use Brave Search to gather information. Extract factual claims with source citations. Identify uncertainties and gaps. Recommend article structure.

writing_agent.user_prompt_template:
Write a Persian fashion blog article based on this research:

**Topic:** {topic}
**Audience:** {audience}
**Length:** {length} words
**Tone:** {tone}

**Research Findings:**
{findings}

**Outline:**
{outline}

**Uncertainties:**
{uncertainties}

**Prohibited Claims:**
{prohibited_claims}

Write in native Persian. Use structured blocks. Insert 1-3 images based on word count.

prompt_agent.user_prompt_template:
Generate image prompts for a Persian fashion blog article:

**Title:** {title}
**Category:** {category}
**Content Summary:** {content_summary}

Generate:
1. One cover image prompt (16:9 aspect ratio, 1200x630 pixels)
2. {image_count} inline image prompts (16:10 aspect ratio, 1600x1000 pixels)

Use Voxcina brand colors. Suggest fashion-related imagery. Write prompts in English for image model compatibility, but provide alt text and captions in Persian.
